  <PropertyGroup>
    <TinkwellPackageGroup>SDK</TinkwellPackageGroup>
    <Description>Middleware abstractions for the Tinkwell MQTT runlet. External runlets implement IMqttMiddleware against this library without depending on the MQTT runlet itself.</Description>
